{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19088","headline":"送国子令狐博士赴兴元觐省 · 刘禹锡","name":"送国子令狐博士赴兴元觐省","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相门才子高阳族，学省清资五品官。\n谏院过时荣棣萼，谢庭归去踏芝兰。\n山中花带烟岚晚，栈底江涵雪水寒。\n伯仲到家人尽贺，柳营莲府递相欢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19088.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19088","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}